<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 95 0 R/T(Selected program: Q6 - ways_naive\(n\), the plain recursive solution. It shows a significant limitation as the input grows \(n = 32 already needs 7 million calls and 1,000 steps is impossible\). The redesign must be reasoned from the problem, not just swap in a library function. )/E(Selected program: Q6 - ways_naive\(n\), the plain recursive solution. It shows a significant limitation as the input grows \(n = 32 already needs 7 million calls and 1,000 steps is impossible\). The redesign must be reasoned from the problem, not just swap in a library function. )/Pg 30 0 R/K[4]>>
