<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 96 0 R/T(step, so almost all the work is unnecessarily repeated: for n = 30, 99.999% of the calls recompute a value already known \(the n = 5 call tree shows ways\(1\) computed five times\). The recursion depth \(n\) is not the bottleneck for small n but becomes a second limit at n = 1000 \(RecursionError\). )/E(step, so almost all the work is unnecessarily repeated: for n = 30, 99.999% of the calls recompute a value already known \(the n = 5 call tree shows ways\(1\) computed five times\). The recursion depth \(n\) is not the bottleneck for small n but becomes a second limit at n = 1000 \(RecursionError\). )/Pg 31 0 R/K[3]>>
