1342 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 96 0 R/T(Objective: compute the number of ways for any n up to at least 1,000 with O\(n\) time \(at most n-1 additions, no repeated sub-problem\), O\(1\) extra memory beyond the answer, no dependence on the recursion limit, and results identical to the original for every n tested \(n = 0 to 32\). Measurable: for n = 30 fewer than 100 operations \(original: 2,692,537\), and n = 1000 in under 0.01 s. )/E(Objective: compute the number of ways for any n up to at least 1,000 with O\(n\) time \(at most n-1 additions, no repeated sub-problem\), O\(1\) extra memory beyond the answer, no dependence on the recursion limit, and results identical to the original for every n tested \(n = 0 to 32\). Measurable: for n = 30 fewer than 100 operations \(original: 2,692,537\), and n = 1000 in under 0.01 s. )/Pg 31 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

1343 0 obj
