1542 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 98 0 R/T(Same inputs, same results, countsand timesforboth versions. The hand-written dictionary memo \(alsovalidated, True\) needs 2n-1 calls \(59 for n=30\). The redesign alone: n = 1,000 in 0.00068 s with 476 bytes of peakextra memory \(209 digits\); n = 10,000in0.00842 s;n=100,000 in 0.14344 s \(20,898 digits\) - the time is slightlyworse than linear at the largest n becauseof big-integeraddition, as noted in the trade-offs. )/E(Same inputs, same results, countsand timesforboth versions. The hand-written dictionary memo \(alsovalidated, True\) needs 2n-1 calls \(59 for n=30\). The redesign alone: n = 1,000 in 0.00068 s with 476 bytes of peakextra memory \(209 digits\); n = 10,000in0.00842 s;n=100,000 in 0.14344 s \(20,898 digits\) - the time is slightlyworse than linear at the largest n becauseof big-integeraddition, as noted in the trade-offs. )/Pg 33 0 R/K[107]>>
endobj

1543 0 obj
