<</Title(Observed vs predicted: all eight predictions were correct fortheif-elif-else version and for the chained separate-if version. The developer's version gave household1\(80units, ration card\) both FULL and PARTIAL. Using the chained comparison 101 <= units <= 200 makesthe separate ifs mutually exclusive and removes the double subsidy. The match-case and table versions agreedwith the elif rule for every units value 0-400 and both flags \(True\).)/Dest[13 0 R/Fit]/Parent 2047 0 R>>
endobj

