2140 0 obj
<</Title(Both growlinearly with k, as predicted. The chain was faster in every row because the table loopadds a for-loop and tupleunpacking per step; the table's benefit is that adding a slab is a data change, not a codechange. With a large k andsorted limits, bisect would give O\(log k\).)/Dest[13 0 R/Fit]/Parent 2126 0 R/Prev 2153 0 R>>
endobj

