<</Title(stack from overflowing. Memoisation removes the repeated work but not the depth: ways_memo\(1000\) calls ways_memo\(999\), which calls ways_memo\(998\), and so on, so the stack is about 1,000 deep before the first value is returned. In my run n = 500 still worked and n = 1000 failed.)/Dest[30 0 R/Fit]/Parent 2446 0 R/Prev 2466 0 R/Next 2454 0 R>>
